{"product_id":"immorality-engine-newbury-hobbes","title":"Immorality Engine Newbury \u0026 Hobbes","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the bizarre and dangerous world of Victorian London, a city teetering on the edge of revolution. Its people are ushering in a new era of technology, dazzled each day by new inventions. Airships soar in the skies over the city, whilst ground trains rumble through the streets and clockwork automatons are programmed to carry out menial tasks in the offices of lawyers, policemen and journalists. But beneath this shiny veneer of progress lurks a sinister side. For this is also a world where lycanthropy is a rampant disease that plagues the dirty whorehouses of Whitechapel, where poltergeist infestations create havoc in old country seats, where cadavers can rise from the dead and where nobody ever goes near the Natural History Museum. The Immorality Engine is the third in the Newbury and Hobbes series.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: George Mann\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781783298297\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45754975256729,"sku":"16RC-3-9781783298297","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d8f9a37577e_Immorality_Engine_Newbury___Hobbes_George_Mann.jpg?v=1759144932","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/immorality-engine-newbury-hobbes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}